  "body": "Lovingly held for more than 20 years, this spacious four-bedroom, two-bathroom home combines character, versatility and relaxed coastal living. \r\n\r\nWith three versatile living areas, light-filled interiors and generous outdoor spaces, there is room for the whole family. The downstairs rumpus, currently utilised as a fifth bedroom, offers additional flexibility with a walk-in wardrobe and ample storage.\r\n\r\nWhat You’ll Love About This Home:\r\n\r\n•North-facing outdoor entertaining area capturing all-day sun\r\n•Indoor-outdoor flow from the main living area and master bedroom to a sunny courtyard with a private spa\r\n•High ceilings and light-filled interiors\r\n•Four bedrooms, including two with unique loft spaces and walk-in wardrobes\r\n•Freshly laid carpet, two heat-pumps, a fireplace and separate laundry\r\n•Fully fenced grounds with flat lawn areas and a private courtyard\r\n•Internal-access garage and generous off-street parking for a boat, campervan and additional vehicles\r\n•A short stroll to Murrays Bay Primary and Intermediate, with zoning for Rangitoto College\r\n•Beautiful local beaches and everyday amenities just minutes away\r\n\r\nGenerous proportions and inviting character create a welcoming atmosphere throughout, while the multiple living areas provide options for entertaining, relaxing or accommodating the changing needs of a growing family. The kitchen benefits from a walk-in pantry, providing valuable additional storage and keeping everyday essentials neatly tucked away.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the main living area and master bedroom open onto the same north-facing courtyard. Complete with a spa, Tiki Bar and adjoining flat lawn. This outdoor sanctuary is perfect for soaking up the sun, unwinding at the end of the day or entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nWith practical parking, versatile living spaces and a sought-after coastal setting, this is a home offering both immediate comfort and the opportunity to add your own personal touches over time.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of having Murrays Bay Primary and Intermediate within walking distance, Rangitoto College zoning, and the area's beautiful beaches close by.\r\n\r\nAfter more than two decades of cherished memories, the owners are ready for their next chapter. Now it's your opportunity to make this welcoming home your own.\r\n\r\nCall today to arrange a private viewing, or we look forward to welcoming you to one of our open homes.",
